    "full_archive_comparisons": "For the cited keys, the saved exact-record tests use source-declared WGS84 geometries and point-in-polygon covers on the exact DBF-matched records, without repair or buffering. The full records are useful source-vintage evidence, not an automatic replacement authority for the simplified source or a current-border certificate.",
